&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic, highly strategic, and deeply creative Senior Program Manager, Strategic Revenue Enablement, to join the Field Enablement team at Okta. Operating as a critical individual contributor on our team, you will be one of the lead architects behind our high-impact, strategic revenue programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for owning, designing, orchestrating and executing key and &quot;always-on&quot; initiatives engineered to accelerate pipeline creation, scale annual recurring revenue (ARR) growth, and drive rapid product adoption across the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be part of a team that acts as a primary conduit between Product, Marketing, and the Field, ensuring all enablement strategies, content, and execution models are seamlessly aligned with company-wide GTM goals and Chief Revenue Officer (CRO) methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Enablement Strategy &amp;amp; Program Ownership: Own and execute highly complex, cross-functional enablement programs. Help lead the global sales enablement marketing strategy developing repeatable programs, messaging frameworks, pitch materials, and playbooks that drive ARR pipeline growth and help sellers communicate Okta’s value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Lap Program Partnership: Partner with the program lead on the weekly production, programming, and content execution of Lead Lap (our weekly GTM broadcast for customer-facing teams). Co-manage a rolling 6-8 week roadmap, coordinate peer-led &quot;what to know, say, and do&quot; segments, and drive metrics to increase viewership and CSAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the Story Arc: Partner with Product Marketing to translate complex product launches, positioning, pricing, and competitive intelligence into clear, compelling &quot;story arcs&quot; and easy-to-use sales content (including sales plays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Presentation &amp;amp; Stakeholder Influence: Serve as a primary presenter and evangelist across internal audiences. Deliver high-energy enablement sessions, product webinars, and rollouts that drive behavior change. Incorporate external perspectives including customers, executives, and industry experts to deepen seller market knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative Motions &amp;amp; Experiential Enablement: Drive creative enablement motions beyond traditional static decks. Build and scale immersive, experiential seller education—including in-person/hybrid workshops, roadshows, and interactive call scripts across priority Okta hub locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Innovation (&quot;What&#39;s Next, New, and Better&quot;): Actively audit existing enablement programs and seller adoption to creatively optimize our work. Research and pitch innovative trends to keep programs ahead of the curve. Partner with Customer Marketing to turn customer stories and testimonials into compelling sales proof points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable Content Engine: Transform live enablement sessions, customer conversations, events and announcements into a scalable engine of reusable video, digital, and written content. Align enablement with Okta’s priority events to ensure sellers convert event momentum into continued sales action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Operational Analytics: Partner on the design of robust measurement frameworks to track program adoption, content engagement, feedback, ROI, and ARR impact. Regularly communicate transparent, data-driven outcomes directly to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, identity, or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce CRM and sales enablement platforms (e.g., Seismic, Highspot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience incorporating customers, executives, or industry influencers into B2B enablement and event programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering programs across global markets and distributed sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P17294&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-TP2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Below is the annual base salary range for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York and Washington. Your actual base salary will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable), bonus, and benefits, including health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k), flexible spending account, and paid leave (including PTO and parental leave) in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit:&lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/us&quot;&gt; https://rewards.okta.com/us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual base salary range for this position for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York, and Washington is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
